      "id": "claim_97bdb3d2e08044b0b426e852d87afb90",
      "statement": "store.NewWithIAM selects among three Store implementations in order: IAM-token Postgres when any of ROSA_TA_DB_HOST/PORT/NAME/USER is set (requiring the full host/port/name/user/region contract or failing loudly rather than falling back silently), legacy password-DSN Postgres when DATABASE_URL has a postgres:// or postgresql:// prefix, and SQLiteStore otherwise; both Postgres paths share the same postgres migration set while SQLite runs its own.",
