      "id": "claim_40e8666964fa4d66b2b6cdd3a53f168c",
      "statement": "newIAMPostgresStore authenticates to Postgres with per-physical-connection RDS IAM tokens minted from ambient AWS credentials (never a static password): a database/sql Connector mints a fresh token per dial via aws-sdk-go-v2's rds/auth package, and the pool's ConnMaxLifetime is capped at 10 minutes so a pooled connection cannot outlive the token's 15-minute validity.",
