      "id": "claim_86e3dfb933ab4e908ffa8ebde0bb594f",
      "statement": "IAM-token Postgres is the production-intended data store path superseding the legacy DATABASE_URL Postgres path: cmd/server/main.go documents that NewWithIAM gives the IAM-token path precedence over legacy DATABASE_URL schemes during an expand phase, while current regional Terraform (terraform/regional/ecs.tf) still hardcodes DATABASE_URL to a file-backed SQLite path and sets none of the ROSA_TA_DB_* variables, so a production RDS/Aurora cutover would adopt the IAM-token path rather than the legacy DSN path.",
