      "id": "claim_ce4bf468721a48c1bb45711a99206814",
      "statement": "`make localstack-db`, `make run-localstack-db`, and `make localstack-db-down` form a dev/test convenience workflow distinct from production RDS IAM auth: the same store.NewWithIAM/newIAMPostgresStore code and ROSA_TA_DB_* contract is exercised locally against LocalStack's emulated RDS and static test AWS credentials, whereas production applies the identical mechanism against a real AWS RDS/Aurora instance with real ambient AWS credentials.",
